			"notes": "# 1.0.0-alpha.3\n\n## Additions\n\n### World Generation\nTin Ore and Deepslate Tin Ore now generate naturally in the world. Tin Ore and Raw Tin Block can also generate in Tin veins.\n\n### Recipes\n- Raw Tin can be smelted into Tin Ingot\n- 9 Raw Tin can be crafted into a Raw Tin Block\n- A Raw Tin Block can be crafted into 9 Raw Tin\n- 9 Tin Ingots can be crafted into a Tin Block\n- A Tin Block can be crafted into 9 Tin Ingots\n- 9 Tin Nuggets can be crafted into a Tin Ingot\n- A Tin Ingot can be crafted into 9 Tin Nuggets\n\n### Advancements\nTin-tastic! is a new advancement acquired after smelting raw tin into a tin ingot."
		},
